1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:11,067
Ab sabse zaroori kaam, billing.

2
00:00:11,107 --> 00:00:16,961
Billing screen keyboard se chalne ke liye bani
hai: search box mein naam likhiye,

3
00:00:17,001 --> 00:00:20,963
Enter se pehla item cart mein, aur F9 se bill
complete.

4
00:00:21,707 --> 00:00:25,366
Search box mein brand ka naam likhiye, jaise
Paracip.

5
00:00:25,406 --> 00:00:29,205
Enter dabaate hi pehli medicine cart mein aa
jaati hai.

6
00:00:29,952 --> 00:00:31,977
Salt se bhi khoj sakte hain.

7
00:00:32,017 --> 00:00:36,329
Cetirizine likhne par usi salt wali medicine mil
jaati hai.

8
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:40,533
Aur pack ke barcode number se bhi medicine mil
jaati hai.

9
00:00:41,292 --> 00:00:44,436
Cart mein quantity plus-minus se badliye.

10
00:00:44,476 --> 00:00:48,163
Strip ki jagah loose tablet bhi chun sakte hain.

11
00:00:48,203 --> 00:00:55,385
Batch aapko chunna nahi padta: Medoro FEFO se
sabse pehle expire hone wala batch lagaata hai.

12
00:00:56,138 --> 00:00:57,735
Ab customer jodte hain.

13
00:00:57,775 --> 00:01:02,289
Mobile number daalte hi purana customer pehchaan
liya jaata hai.

14
00:01:02,329 --> 00:01:05,776
Bill WhatsApp par bhejne ka option bhi yahin
hai.

15
00:01:06,519 --> 00:01:14,279
Discount utna hi de sakte hain jitni aapke role
ko anumati hai; yahan owner ke liye bees
pratishat tak.

16
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:17,156
Paanch pratishat discount daalte hain.

17
00:01:17,196 --> 00:01:22,154
MRP total, round off aur payable amount apne-aap
badal jaate hain.

18
00:01:22,906 --> 00:01:29,743
Payment mode chuniye: Cash, UPI, Card, ya
registered customer ke liye Credit.

19
00:01:29,783 --> 00:01:33,137
Yeh customer UPI se pay kar rahe hain.

20
00:01:33,177 --> 00:01:34,208
F9 dabaaiye.

21
00:01:34,950 --> 00:01:36,184
Bill ban gaya.

22
00:01:36,224 --> 00:01:43,644
Tax invoice par pharmacy ka GSTIN aur drug
licence, har item ka batch, expiry, HSN

23
00:01:43,684 --> 00:01:48,739
aur GST, aur neeche CGST aur SGST ka hisaab
chhapta hai.

24
00:01:48,779 --> 00:01:52,287
MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota hai.

25
00:01:53,060 --> 00:02:01,592
Print dabaakar receipt printer par chhaapiye;
browser ke print mein 'Save as PDF' chunkar PDF
invoice bhi bana sakte hain.

26
00:02:01,632 --> 00:02:05,386
WhatsApp juda ho, to PDF seedhe customer ko
jaata hai.

27
00:02:06,152 --> 00:02:07,967
Ek aur bill: card payment.

28
00:02:08,007 --> 00:02:13,602
Aur credit customer ke liye Credit chunne par
rakam uske khaate mein jaati hai,

29
00:02:13,642 --> 00:02:14,814
credit limit tak.

30
00:02:14,854 --> 00:02:20,235
Dhyan dein: is device counter par ek bill ka
bhugtaan do modes mein baantna,

31
00:02:20,275 --> 00:02:24,729
aur cart ko hold karke baad mein kholna, abhi
uplabdh nahi hai.

32
00:02:30,807 --> 00:02:37,131
Schedule H aur H1 ki davaayein sirf registered
doctor ki prescription par bikti hain.

33
00:02:37,171 --> 00:02:40,724
Medoro yeh niyam billing par hi laagu karta hai.

34
00:02:40,764 --> 00:02:47,387
Search list mein aisi medicines ke saath laal
rang mein Sch H ya Sch H1 likha dikhta hai.

35
00:02:48,149 --> 00:02:50,842
Cefidem 200 ek Schedule H1 dava hai.

36
00:02:50,882 --> 00:02:55,094
Ise cart mein daalte hi Prescription section
khulta hai,

37
00:02:55,134 --> 00:02:58,435
aur likha aata hai: Required for Schedule H.

38
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:05,390
Bina prescriber details ke bill poora karne ki
koshish karein, to Medoro bill nahi banata.

39
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,608
Yeh check hataaya nahi ja sakta.

40
00:03:08,385 --> 00:03:14,827
Ab doctor ka naam, unka registration number, aur
H1 dava ke liye patient ka naam bhariye.

41
00:03:14,867 --> 00:03:18,688
Is demo mein doctor aur patient, dono kaalpanik
hain.

42
00:03:19,445 --> 00:03:19,839
Ab F9.

43
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:26,354
Bill ban gaya, aur prescriber ka naam aur
registration number invoice par bhi chhapta hai.

44
00:03:27,123 --> 00:03:33,094
Doctors screen par aap prescribing doctors ka
record rakhte hain: naam, qualification,

45
00:03:33,134 --> 00:03:35,261
registration number aur clinic.

46
00:03:35,301 --> 00:03:40,504
'Sales by doctor' mein har doctor ki
prescriptions se hui bikri dikhti hai.

47
00:03:41,266 --> 00:03:46,024
Prescriber aur patient ki details har bill ke
saath save hoti hain,

48
00:03:46,064 --> 00:03:48,101
aur invoice par chhapti hain.

49
00:03:48,141 --> 00:03:59,200
Ek zaroori baat: alag Schedule H1 register wali
report is Google Drive wale counter par abhi
uplabdh nahi hai; humne ise apni QA report mein darj kiya hai.

50
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:03,425
Medoro legal check ko bypass karne ka koi raasta
nahi deta.

51
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:12,056
Customer dava waapas karne aaya hai.

52
00:04:12,096 --> 00:04:14,454
'Bills & day-end' screen kholiye.

53
00:04:14,494 --> 00:04:20,557
Yahan invoice number, customer ke naam ya mobile
se koi bhi bill dhoondh sakte hain.

54
00:04:21,303 --> 00:04:22,384
Bill mil gaya.

55
00:04:22,424 --> 00:04:24,305
Return par click kijiye.

56
00:04:24,345 --> 00:04:26,547
Bill ki har line dikhti hai,

57
00:04:26,587 --> 00:04:33,032
aur har line par utni hi maatra waapas ho sakti
hai jitni biki thi, usi batch ki.

58
00:04:33,798 --> 00:04:39,025
Waapas aayi maatra daaliye, aur kaaran likhiye,
jaise doctor ne dava badal di.

59
00:04:39,065 --> 00:04:46,319
Condition mein Sealed chunein to dava waapas
stock mein jaati hai; Damaged chunein to stock
mein nahi judti.

60
00:04:47,095 --> 00:04:53,728
Refund kaise hoga, yeh chuniye: cash, UPI, ya
customer ke account mein credit.

61
00:04:53,768 --> 00:04:57,748
Refund ki rakam GST samet apne-aap nikalti hai.

62
00:04:58,511 --> 00:05:04,052
'Issue credit note' dabaate hi credit note banta
hai: stock waapas, refund darj,

63
00:05:04,092 --> 00:05:07,261
aur day-end mein Returns ke neeche dikhta hai.

64
00:05:07,301 --> 00:05:12,354
Bill kabhi edit ya delete nahi hota, isliye
poora itihaas saaf rehta hai.

65
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:17,461
Day-end summary mein aaj ke bills, cash, UPI,
card, returns

66
00:05:17,501 --> 00:05:21,768
aur drawer mein kitna cash hona chahiye, sab ek
jagah hai.

67
00:05:21,808 --> 00:05:24,813
'Print day-end' se ise chhaap sakte hain.
